B.aBz=new A.zT("Anahtar teslim ta\u015f\u0131mac\u0131l\u0131k ve lojistik \xe7\xf6z\xfcmleri","\u0130\u015finiz i\xe7in\ng\xfcvenilir lojistik","Uluslararas\u0131 g\xf6nderileri planlay\u0131n, teslimatlar\u0131 takip edin ve sipari\u015fleri tek yerden y\xf6netin.","7/24 Destek","Tam Hizmet","\u015eirket hakk\u0131nda","APS Express, uluslararas\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131mac\u0131l\u0131k, konsolide kargo teslimat\u0131 ve ticari g\xf6nderi deste\u011fi i\xe7in tam kapsaml\u0131 hizmet sunan modern bir lojistik operat\xf6r\xfcd\xfcr.","Her \xf6l\xe7ekte i\u015fletmeyle \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor, evrak i\u015flemlerinden son teslimata kadar lojisti\u011fin t\xfcm a\u015famalar\u0131n\u0131 \xfcstleniyoruz.","Ne yap\u0131yoruz","Uluslararas\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131mac\u0131l\u0131k ve ticari lojistik i\xe7in anahtar teslim hizmet.",B.a9x,"\u0130lk g\xf6nderinizi ba\u015flatmaya haz\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z?","Sipari\u015fler b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcn\xfc a\xe7\u0131n veya h\u0131zl\u0131 al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f i\xe7in ma\u011fazaya gidin.","Sipari\u015flere git","Ma\u011fazay\u0131 a\xe7")
